cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in your research or project, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "EnviMet-automation-Protocol: Standardized Environmental Modeling Automation and QGIS Plugin"
abstract: >-
  A standardized protocol and QGIS 4 automation plugin for ENVI-met microclimate
  modeling developed within the LIFE A_GreeNET project. It automates geospatial data
  acquisition, 3D model generation, sub-area scenario analysis, and integrates with
  EnviReader for advanced simulation data visualization and analysis.
